namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamGlass {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamGlass.h#DreamGlass
    src   "Refractive glass: what is behind it seen through a slab whose edge bends the light in, the red and blue channels bending a\nlittle apart; optionally frosted, tinted, its saturation and brightness changed; an edge highlight from a light at an\nangle and an inner shadow. Its shape is a rounded rect of its widget's size, its corners as a rect block's, or the shape\na shape blend group melts its rect blocks into (EDreamGlassShape::ShapeBlend); a click outside the shape misses it.\n\nDrawn by DreamGUI's own renderer, as the other effects that read what is behind are. Its alpha (its colour's, its\nwidgets' opacity) fades it."
    text  "折射玻璃：透过一块边缘将光线向内弯折的板面看到其背后的内容，红色和蓝色通道的弯折\n略有差异；可选磨砂、着色，改变其饱和度和亮度；来自某个角度的光的边缘高光\n以及内阴影。其形状为其控件大小的圆角矩形、与矩形块相同的圆角，或形状\n混合组将其矩形块融合成的形状（EDreamGlassShape::ShapeBlend）；在形状之外点击不会命中它。\n\n由 DreamGUI 自己的渲染器绘制，与其他读取背后内容的特效一样。其 alpha（其颜色的、其\n控件的透明度）使其淡出。"
    state machine
}

DreamGlass:Brightness {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamGlass.h#DreamGlass:Brightness
    src   "Added to what is seen through."
    text  "添加到所看到的内容上。"
    state machine
}

DreamGlass:CornerRadius {
