EDreamGlassShape.ShapeBlend {
    at    Source/DreamGUIExtensions/Public/Extensions/Effects/DreamGlass.h#EDreamGlassShape:ShapeBlend
    src   "The shape a shape blend group melts its rect blocks into (UDreamShapeBlendGroup): ShapeBlendGroup's, or this widget's\nown. The glass is drawn over the whole of it, wherever it reaches, its own rect only the frame it is measured in; while\nthe group is off or has no rect block, the glass is the rounded rect."
    text  "形状混合组将其矩形块融合成的形状（UDreamShapeBlendGroup）：ShapeBlendGroup 的，或此控件自身的。\n玻璃绘制在整个形状之上，无论它延伸到哪里；它自己的矩形只是其测量所用的框架；当\n该组关闭或没有矩形块时，玻璃就是圆角矩形。"
    state machine
}

